        "statement": "At any time after the fifth year anniversary of the IPI Agreement, if IPI receives a third-party request to license certain rights granted to us pursuant to the IPI Agreement for which we are not actively developing or commercializing a licensed product, we must either (i) submit a commercially reasonable development plan for such undeveloped field to IPI that we will put into effect within a certain number of days, (ii) substantiate why granting a license to such rights in such undeveloped field to the third party is not in our best business interest or (iii) enter into good faith negotiations with such third party for such rights in such undeveloped field.",
